{"unit_id":"azwosile__dsh-highres-vision#feature-tile","repo":"azwosile/dsh-highres-vision","commit":"9638230e59d6c997814946d9523532713f650b0d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-highres-vision 的图片分块功能：调用 highres_read 读取本地图片或 DSH 附件；大图会生成整图缩略图和重叠子块，再交给宿主 read_image 返回，便于模型查看全局与局部细节。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tile.js:85-160"]}
{"unit_id":"azwosile__dsh-highres-vision#feature-session","repo":"azwosile/dsh-highres-vision","commit":"9638230e59d6c997814946d9523532713f650b0d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-highres-vision 的会话图片读取功能：调用 highres_read 时可不传图片路径，插件会从当前会话最近的用户图片附件读取图像；也可指定本地路径或 attachmentId，输出整图及分块的识图结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:436-450"]}
{"unit_id":"azwosile__dsh-highres-vision#feature-gate","repo":"azwosile/dsh-highres-vision","commit":"9638230e59d6c997814946d9523532713f650b0d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-highres-vision 的 DeepSeek 会话门控功能：插件依据会话当前模型选择是否开放 highres_read；非 DeepSeek 模型下屏蔽该工具，模型切换时重新判断，避免在不匹配的视觉会话中提供该能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/model-detect.js:105-125"]}
{"unit_id":"azwosile__dsh-highres-vision#feature-budget","repo":"azwosile/dsh-highres-vision","commit":"9638230e59d6c997814946d9523532713f650b0d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-highres-vision 的图片预算调整功能：插件加载后可通过 DSH settings 更新 DeepSeek 模型条目的图片像素与字节预算，让较大的图片分块不被较低的模型预算再次缩小；设置服务不可用时其余工具功能仍可工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/model-budget.js:168-195"]}
{"unit_id":"azwosile__dsh-highres-vision#feature-remind","repo":"azwosile/dsh-highres-vision","commit":"9638230e59d6c997814946d9523532713f650b0d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-highres-vision 的大图提醒功能：当用户消息包含超过提醒阈值的图片，且当前会话尚未调用 highres_read 时，插件在 agent 步骤前添加提示，建议先读取整图和高清分块。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:574-598"]}
